    end

    subgraph Ext["External Services"]
        Stripe["Stripe<br/>Checkout + Webhook"]
        Resend["Resend<br/>Transactional Email"]
    end

    Z -.-> UI
    UI <-->|"HTTPS"| Next
    Next <--> Auth
    Auth --> PG
    Next <-->|"Prisma queries"| PG
